Add the opt-in `--pipeline-profile <file>` option, which writes timing events of the verification pipeline to a file, one JSON object per line: parsing, resolution, per-module translation to Boogie and Boogie's preparation, and each verification task's queue wait and solver time, with allocation, garbage-collection and CPU deltas. Dafny's other output is unchanged (https://github.com/erniecohen/dafny/issues/241).
